{"id":"d0e294138a289a56","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-pfp.md","title":"部分不动点 PFP","display":"df-pfp — 部分不动点 PFP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-pfp","aliases":["29-df-pfp"],"display":"df-pfp — 部分不动点 PFP","depends_on":["[[29-df-inductive-def]]","[[29-lem-iteration-orbit]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 10.12, p.161, DjVu scan 176","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-pfp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-pfp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pfp — 部分不动点 PFP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0de5e873dd7a7151\" href=\"?note=0de5e873dd7a7151\" title=\"29-df-inductive-def\">29-df-inductive-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9dbb4ca7eb32ec76\" href=\"?note=9dbb4ca7eb32ec76\" title=\"29-lem-iteration-orbit\">29-lem-iteration-orbit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 10.12, p.161, DjVu scan 176"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(R,\\bar x)\">\\(\\varphi(R,\\bar x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\">\\(F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\">\\(R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0de5e873dd7a7151\" href=\"?note=0de5e873dd7a7151\" title=\"29-df-inductive-def\">29-df-inductive-def</a>；不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 正出现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\mathbb N\\mid m&lt;2^{n^k}\\land R_m^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=R_{m+1}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\mathbb N\\mid m&lt;2^{n^k}\\land R_m^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=R_{m+1}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R_{\\min M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi},&amp;M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R_{\\min M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi},&amp;M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 10.12，印刷页 161，扫描页 176。状态总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^k}\">\\(2^{n^k}\\)</span>；在此范围内没有相邻重复，则之后只能进入长度大于一的循环，按定义返回空关系。多于一个稳定阶段时所有稳定值相同。有限状态截断与最终周期的显式证明见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9dbb4ca7eb32ec76\" href=\"?note=9dbb4ca7eb32ec76\" title=\"29-lem-iteration-orbit\">29-lem-iteration-orbit</a>，取一个关系及空初态即可；本次同时查看了扫描页176的原始分段定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-inductive-def","status":"resolved","id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-inductive-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-lem-iteration-orbit","status":"resolved","id":"9dbb4ca7eb32ec76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-lem-iteration-orbit]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-inductive-def","status":"resolved","id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi(R,\\bar x)$、$F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}$ 与 $R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}$ 满足 [[29-df-inductive-def]]；不要求 $R$ 正出现。","embed":false},{"target":"29-lem-iteration-orbit","status":"resolved","id":"9dbb4ca7eb32ec76","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definition 10.12，印刷页 161，扫描页 176。状态总数为 $2^{n^k}$；在此范围内没有相邻重复，则之后只能进入长度大于一的循环，按定义返回空关系。多于一个稳定阶段时所有稳定值相同。有限状态截断与最终周期的显式证明见 [[29-lem-iteration-orbit]]，取一个关系及空初态即可；本次同时查看了扫描页176的原始分段定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(R,\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\mathbb N\\mid m<2^{n^k}\\land R_m^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=R_{m+1}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R_{\\min M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}}^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi},&M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\\varnothing,&M_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=\\varnothing.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"2^{n^k}","display":false}],"bytes":1722,"backlinks":[{"id":"9f21a81def92d642","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PFP}$ 的稳定及循环默认值见 [[29-df-pfp]]；下式用 $\\mathrm{PFP}$ 标记扩张语义。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-lfp]]、[[29-df-pfp]]、[[29-df-tc]] — LFP、PFP、TC 算子"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-pfp]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-pfp]]"}],"outgoing":["0de5e873dd7a7151","9dbb4ca7eb32ec76"]}